IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CALCWRAP.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 WRAP-REQUEST.
   05 WRAP-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 WRAP-COUNT PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
   05 WRAP-RATE PIC 9V99.
01 WRAP-RESULT PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WRAP-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WRAP-REQUEST WRAP-RESULT WRAP-STATUS.
MAIN-WRAPPER.
    MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-RESULT WRAP-STATUS.
    PERFORM RUN-WORKER THRU WORKER-END.
    IF WRAP-STATUS NOT = ZERO
        MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-RESULT
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
RUN-WORKER.
    CALL 'SHAREDWK' USING BY REFERENCE WRAP-REQUEST
        WRAP-RESULT WRAP-STATUS
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 92 TO WRAP-STATUS
            MOVE ZERO TO WRAP-RESULT
    END-CALL.
WORKER-END.
    EXIT.
